# ClubPulse 📊

ClubPulse is a full-stack web application designed for collecting and managing anonymous feedback for various events. Built with the MERN stack, it features a public-facing feedback form and a secure, JWT-authenticated admin dashboard for event creation and data analysis.

## 🚀 Features

* **Anonymous Feedback Form:** Users can select an event, leave a message, and submit a 1-5 star rating.
* **Secure Admin Dashboard:** Protected by JWT authentication.
* **Dynamic Data Filtering:** Admins can filter feedback by specific events.
* **Real-time Analytics:** Automatically calculates total feedback count and average ratings based on the selected event filter.
* **Event Management:** Admins can seamlessly create and add new events to the database.
* **Responsive UI:** Clean, modern interface styled entirely with Tailwind CSS.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

* **Frontend:** React (Vite), Tailwind CSS, React Router DOM, Axios, Lucide React
* **Backend:** Node.js, Express.js, JWT (JSON Web Tokens)
* **Database:** MongoDB Atlas & Mongoose
* **Deployment:** GitHub, Render (Backend)

## 📁 Project Structure

```text
clubpulse/
├── backend/
│   ├── models/
│   │   ├── Event.js       # Mongoose schema for events
│   │   └── Feedback.js    # Mongoose schema for feedback
│   ├── .env               # Backend environment variables
│   └── server.js          # Express server and API routes
└── frontend/
    ├── src/
    │   ├── components/
    │   │   ├── AdminDashboard.jsx
    │   │   ├── AdminLogin.jsx
    │   │   └── FeedbackForm.jsx
    │   ├── App.jsx        # Routing configuration
    │   └── index.css      # Tailwind directives
    ├── .env               # Frontend environment variables
    └── tailwind.config.js # Tailwind configuration


=================================================================================================




🔐 Environment Variables
To run this project locally, you will need to create .env files in both the backend and frontend directories.
-----------------------------------------------
backend/.env

Code snippet

MONGO_URI=mongodb+srv://<username>:<password>@cluster0.xxxxx.mongodb.net/clubpulse?retryWrites=true&w=majority
SECRET_KEY=your_super_secret_jwt_key
PORT=5000

-----------------------------------------------
frontend/.env

Code snippet

VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000

=================================================================================================
💻 Local Installation & Setup
Clone the repository:

Bash
git clone [https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/CODE-IO.git](https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/CODE-IO.git)
cd CODE-IO
--------------------
Set up the Backend:

Bash

cd backend
npm install
node server.js

The backend will run on http://localhost:5000.
----------------------
Set up the Frontend:
Open a new terminal window/tab:

Bash

cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
The frontend will run on http://localhost:5173.
=================================================================================================
📡 API Endpoints

Public Routes
GET / - Health check (Returns API status)

GET /api/events - Fetches all available events

POST /api/feedback - Submits new anonymous feedback
=================================================================================================
Protected Admin Routes (Requires JWT)
POST /api/login - Authenticates admin and returns a JWT token

POST /api/admin/events - Creates a new event

GET /api/admin/data - Fetches all feedback data for the dashboard

=================================================================================================


🔑 Default Admin Credentials
Username: admin

Password: admin123
(Note: These can be modified in the server.js login route).

